### DEFRO Backend — REST Client Tests
### Install the "REST Client" VS Code extension to run these

@base = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### ─── Health ───────────────────────────────
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### ─── Auth: Login ──────────────────────────
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@defro.org",
  "password": "Admin@DEFRO2025!"
}

### ─── Auth: Get Me ──────────────────────────
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── Public: Get all projects ──────────────
GET {{base}}/projects

### ─── Public: Get all updates ──────────────
GET {{base}}/updates

### ─── Public: Get gallery ──────────────────
GET {{base}}/gallery

### ─── Public: Submit contact form ──────────
POST {{base}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "subject": "General Inquiry",
  "message": "Hello, I would like to learn more about your work."
}

### ─── Public: Submit volunteer form ────────
POST {{base}}/volunteer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Volunteer",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "phone": "+255712345678",
  "location": "Moshi, Tanzania",
  "interests": ["Education", "Health"],
  "skills": "Teaching, first aid",
  "availability": "Weekends",
  "message": "I want to help with the education programs."
}

### ─── Admin: Dashboard stats ───────────────
GET {{base}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── Admin: Get all contacts ──────────────
GET {{base}}/admin/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── Admin: Get all volunteers ────────────
GET {{base}}/admin/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── Admin: Update contact status ─────────
PATCH {{base}}/admin/contacts/CONTACT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "read",
  "adminNotes": "Responded via email"
}

### ─── Admin: Update volunteer status ───────
PATCH {{base}}/admin/volunteers/VOLUNTEER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "accepted",
  "adminNotes": "Contacted — starts March 2025"
}

### ─── Admin: Get all updates (incl. drafts) ─
GET {{base}}/admin/updates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── Admin: Create project (JSON only) ────
POST {{base}}/admin/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "New Project",
  "description": "A new community initiative.",
  "category": "Community",
  "status": "Active",
  "order": 9
}

### ─── Admin: Get admin gallery ─────────────
GET {{base}}/admin/gallery
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
